Z||000032||Simple Fiero||12-19-2001||02:41 PM||||Okay number one: Mike's I store it up here in Kelowna BC, at my place of work and number 2: It is a teen girlie drink. Basically panty remover with sugar. And the stuff stinks when we spill it, yuck(yah right like we spill it.<P>As far as beer goes, Okanagan Spring Pale Ale.<BR>Or Corona(Mexican Piss or skunk piss) are the 2 best, with black bear a close 3rd, followed by slemans in 4th.<BR>The Okanagan Spring and Slemans brewery in vernon stinks in the summer like burnt wet dog food. A friend thinks it smells like burnt cherrios.<P>Mike's is a Mission Hill (in westbank)Product. Mike's Iced Tea tastes better though.<BR>While the Smirnoff is a Calona Wines Product.(Kelowna)<P>How about a man's drink, Wiser's the full flavored Whiskey. or Jack Daniels, or over proof rye or rum. Now those are manly drinks.<BR>Eww i can't forget Bushmills (so smooth) Irish Whiskey either.<P>God I sound like a know it all alcholic, LOLLOOLOLOL.<BR>Well back to drinking. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
